---

<style>
  a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  button {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .cnf-support {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="cnf-section">
  <div class="cnf-support">
    <div class="cnf-support__text">
      <h3>Fancy supporting the club?</h3>
      <p>
        If you're enjoying what we're at, why not chip in and help keep things
        going!
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="cnf-support__action">
      <a href="https://ko-fi.com/clubnafealsunachta" target="_blank">
        <button class="cnf-button cnf-button__secondary">
          <span class="cnf-button__text">Supply the tea</span>
          <span class="cnf-button__emoji">&#9749;</span></button
        >
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
